In article <1s7r1r$c6@agate.berkeley.edu> grantham@beirut.berkeley.edu (Jon Grantham) writes:
>What can I do after I anger my god, and every time I pray, I get a feeling
>of inadequacy?

Find a co-aligned altar and start sacrificing.  If you're chaotic, you can
convert the altar and start appeasing your god by sacrificing one of your
own species (i.e. if you're an elf, sacrifice an elf, if human, sacrifice a
human.)  If you're neutral or lawful, you have to look till you find one of
your alignment.  Two or three sacrifices will usually absolve you.

